Upstream OpenCE PR #564, commit 8466202e96c91f060d44fcb3506cf95edcb3d2c8 (FullHavocJosh):
"Replace stale static geometry buffers when a map loads over them".
Only its port/linux/src/d3d8_gl.c change; scripts/xbox/static_geometry.py applies the hunks to build 359.
OpenCE's licence (AGPL-3.0, the engine's LICENSE) covers this patch, as it does the engine HaloPad builds.

